      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-02",
      "scene_type": "recap",
      "title": "Last Week's Lesson",
      "start_frame": 240,
      "duration_frames": 465,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-02",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-5a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns",
        "caption_strip": true
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-02-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 252,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-02/scene-02-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Do you remember last week? God sent hail and fire, then locusts, then thick darkness for three whole days."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-02-line-02",
          "start_frame": 270,
          "duration_frames": 195,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-02/scene-02-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "But God's people in Goshen had light! And now — the final warning is here."
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-03",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Objectives",
      "start_frame": 690,
      "duration_frames": 363,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-03",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": null,
        "animation": "ken-burns",
        "subtitle_bg_color": "#fff5e6"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-03-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 363,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-03/scene-03-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "By the end of today, you will be able to: tell the Passover story, explain the blood on the door, see God as a promise-keeper, and choose to keep obeying God."
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-04",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Memory Verse",
      "start_frame": 1038,
      "duration_frames": 287,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-04",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-1c.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns",
        "verse_overlay": true
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-04-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 98,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-04/scene-04-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Here is our memory verse. Can you say it with me?"
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-04-line-02",
          "start_frame": 116,
          "duration_frames": 171,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-04/scene-04-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "When I see the blood, I will pass over you. — Exodus twelve, thirteen."
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-05",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Big Questions",
      "start_frame": 1310,
      "duration_frames": 584,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-05",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-5a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-05-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 114,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-05/scene-05-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Today we will find answers to three big questions."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-05-line-02",
          "start_frame": 132,
          "duration_frames": 123,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-05/scene-05-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Why did God tell the Israelites to put blood on their doors?"
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-05-line-03",
          "start_frame": 273,
          "duration_frames": 123,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-05/scene-05-line-03.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "How did God keep His promise to deliver His people?"
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-05-line-04",
          "start_frame": 414,
          "duration_frames": 171,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-05/scene-05-line-04.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "And what does the Passover lamb remind us of today? Let's find out together!"
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-06",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "The Blood on the Door",
      "start_frame": 1879,
      "duration_frames": 135,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-06",
        "type": "section-header",
        "bg_color": "#2a1a45",
        "eyebrow": "✦ PART ONE ✦",
        "title": "The Blood\non the Door",
        "footer": "Exodus 12:1-13",
        "animation": "fade-in"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-06-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 87,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-06/scene-06-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Part One. The Blood on the Door."
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-section-whoosh",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 75,
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-section-whoosh.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-07",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "God's Calendar",
      "start_frame": 1999,
      "duration_frames": 614,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-07",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-1a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-07-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 493,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-07/scene-07-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "God told Moses and Aaron — this month will be your first month. On the tenth day, every family must choose a lamb — a year-old male, without blemish. And on the fourteenth day, at twilight, they must kill it."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-07-line-02",
          "start_frame": 511,
          "duration_frames": 102,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-07/scene-07-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "God always has a plan — and a clock!"
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-lamb-bleat-1",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 90,
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-lamb-bleat-1.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-08",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Bring the Lamb Home",
      "start_frame": 2598,
      "duration_frames": 512,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-08",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-1b.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-08-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 425,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-08/scene-08-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "So every Israelite family chose a perfect little lamb and brought it into their home. They cared for it for four days — petting it, feeding it, learning to love it. The lamb became part of the family."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-08-line-02",
          "start_frame": 443,
          "duration_frames": 69,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-08/scene-08-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Have you ever loved a little animal?"
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-09",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Blood on the Door",
      "start_frame": 3095,
      "duration_frames": 624,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-09",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-1c.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-09-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 385,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-09/scene-09-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "At twilight on the fourteenth day, the father killed the lamb. Then he took a hyssop branch, dipped it in the blood, and brushed the blood on the lintel and the two side-posts of the door."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-09-line-02",
          "start_frame": 403,
          "duration_frames": 102,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-09/scene-09-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The blood was a sign — this house belongs to God."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-09-line-03",
          "start_frame": 523,
          "duration_frames": 101,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-09/scene-09-line-03.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "When God sees the blood, He will pass over you."
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-brush-stroke",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 75,
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-brush-stroke.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-10",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Eat in Haste!",
      "start_frame": 3704,
      "duration_frames": 570,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-10",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-1d.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-10-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 333,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-10/scene-10-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "That same night, the family ate the meal inside — roasted lamb, flat unleavened bread, and bitter herbs. Cloaks tucked in, sandals on, staff in hand."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-10-line-02",
          "start_frame": 351,
          "duration_frames": 94,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-10/scene-10-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Eat it in haste — it is the Lord's Passover!"
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-10-line-03",
          "start_frame": 463,
          "duration_frames": 108,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-10/scene-10-line-03.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Can you pretend to eat something yummy, really fast?"
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-11",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Midnight",
      "start_frame": 4259,
      "duration_frames": 153,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-11",
        "type": "section-header",
        "bg_color": "#1a1a45",
        "eyebrow": "✦ PART TWO ✦",
        "title": "Midnight",
        "footer": "Exodus 12:21-32",
        "animation": "fade-in"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-11-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 108,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-11/scene-11-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Part Two. Midnight. The Destroyer passes."
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-low-rumble",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 75,
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-low-rumble.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-12",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Pass Over!",
      "start_frame": 4397,
      "duration_frames": 459,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-12",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-2a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-12-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 364,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-12/scene-12-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "At midnight, the Lord passed through the land of Egypt. Every house without the blood on the door — the destroyer came inside. But every house WITH the blood — the Lord passed over."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-12-line-02",
          "start_frame": 382,
          "duration_frames": 77,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-12/scene-12-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The blood is the sign that saves."
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-13",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "The Firstborn",
      "start_frame": 4841,
      "duration_frames": 752,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-13",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-2b.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-13-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 440,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-13/scene-13-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "In every Egyptian home without the blood, the firstborn — from Pharaoh's palace to the prisoner's cell — fell asleep and did not wake. There was loud wailing all over Egypt."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-13-line-02",
          "start_frame": 458,
          "duration_frames": 123,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-13/scene-13-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Not one house in Egypt was without someone gone."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-13-line-03",
          "start_frame": 599,
          "duration_frames": 154,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-13/scene-13-line-03.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "It was a deeply sad night. God does not stay quiet forever."
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-14",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Pharaoh's Last Plea",
      "start_frame": 5578,
      "duration_frames": 526,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-14",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-2c.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-14-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 291,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-14/scene-14-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "In the middle of the night, Pharaoh sent for Moses and Aaron. He was done fighting. He begged them — Rise up! Go! Take your flocks, your families — go!"
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-14-line-02",
          "start_frame": 309,
          "duration_frames": 87,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-14/scene-14-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The mighty hand of God had won."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-14-line-03",
          "start_frame": 414,
          "duration_frames": 112,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-14/scene-14-line-03.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "When God decides, even Pharaoh cannot stop it."
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-door-open",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 75,
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-door-open.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-15",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Leave Now!",
      "start_frame": 6089,
      "duration_frames": 528,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-15",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-2d.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-15-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 284,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-15/scene-15-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "All the Egyptians urged the Israelites to leave at once. Go now — or we'll all die! They were done with God's people staying."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-15-line-02",
          "start_frame": 302,
          "duration_frames": 108,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-15/scene-15-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The Lord made the Egyptians willing to let them go."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-15-line-03",
          "start_frame": 428,
          "duration_frames": 100,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-15/scene-15-line-03.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "When God opens a door, nobody can shut it!"
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-16",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Set Free",
      "start_frame": 6602,
      "duration_frames": 143,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-16",
        "type": "section-header",
        "bg_color": "#3a2a1a",
        "eyebrow": "✦ PART THREE ✦",
        "title": "Set Free",
        "footer": "Exodus 12:33-51",
        "animation": "fade-in"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-16-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 143,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-16/scene-16-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Part Three. Set Free. The Wages and the Walk."
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-section-chime-2",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 90,
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-section-chime-2.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-17",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "The Wages They Were Owed",
      "start_frame": 6730,
      "duration_frames": 640,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-17",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-3a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-17-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 344,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-17/scene-17-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Before they left, the Israelites asked their Egyptian neighbors for silver and gold and clothing — the wages for all those years of hard work. And the Egyptians gave it freely."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-17-line-02",
          "start_frame": 362,
          "duration_frames": 121,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-17/scene-17-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "God had made the Egyptians willing to bless His people."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-17-line-03",
          "start_frame": 501,
          "duration_frames": 139,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-17/scene-17-line-03.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "If someone has hurt you, ask God to bless them — like this!"
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [
        {
          "id": "sfx-coins-jingle",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 75,
          "audio_file": "audio/sfx/sfx-coins-jingle.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-18",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "The Great March-Out",
      "start_frame": 7355,
      "duration_frames": 670,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-18",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-3b.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns"
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-18-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 369,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-18/scene-18-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "That very day, the Israelites left Rameses — about six hundred thousand men, plus women and children and many other people, with their flocks and herds. They headed for Succoth."
        },
        {
