          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 211,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-24/scene-24-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "Number three! God promised to deliver Israel with a mighty hand. At midnight, Pharaoh begged them to leave."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-24-line-02",
          "start_frame": 229,
          "duration_frames": 262,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-24/scene-24-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "God promised Moses that He would deliver the Israelites by a powerful hand — and He did! Whatever God promises me, He will fulfill. I believe!"
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-25",
      "scene_type": "lesson",
      "title": "Diary 4 — Keep Hearing God",
      "start_frame": 10698,
      "duration_frames": 327,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-25",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-1a.png",
        "animation": "ken-burns",
        "diary_card": true
      },
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "id": "scene-25-line-01",
          "start_frame": 0,
          "duration_frames": 201,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-25/scene-25-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "Number four! Moses heard God and kept believing — even after Pharaoh refused him over and over again."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-25-line-02",
          "start_frame": 219,
          "duration_frames": 109,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-25/scene-25-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Angela",
          "text": "I want to hear God like Moses — and believe, no matter what!"
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-26",
      "scene_type": "activity",
      "title": "Application — A-B-C of Salvation",
      "start_frame": 11010,
      "duration_frames": 562,
      "transition": "fade",
      "transition_frames": 15,
      "visual": {
        "id": "vis-26",
        "type": "image",
        "asset_file": "assets/scene-4a.png",
