          "audio_file": "audio/scene-26/scene-26-line-01.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "If you are saved, thank God for His tender care. If the blood of Jesus has not covered your sin, you are marked for death!"
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-26-line-02",
          "start_frame": 304,
          "duration_frames": 259,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-26/scene-26-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "To be rescued — A — Admit you have sinned. B — Believe Jesus died for you. C — Call on His name!"
        }
      ],
      "sound_effects": [],
      "background_music": "bgm-main"
    },
