          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Today we learned about the Passover — Mighty Hand, Tender Care."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-27-line-02",
          "start_frame": 152,
          "duration_frames": 408,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-27/scene-27-line-02.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "The lamb's blood saved the Israelites. The destroyer passed over every marked house. God's mighty hand kept His promise. And Jesus is the Lamb of God for the whole world."
        },
        {
          "id": "scene-27-line-03",
          "start_frame": 578,
          "duration_frames": 82,
          "audio_file": "audio/scene-27/scene-27-line-03.mp3",
          "character": "Narrator",
          "text": "Thank God for His tender care today!"
        }
      ],
